    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "ValueRange.of(smallestMinimum, largestMinimum, smallestMaximum, largestMaximum) captures how field boundaries vary across dates. St. Tib's Day (the Discordian leap-day) sits in pseudo-month 0 and is not part of any regular week, so every week/day field may legitimately be 0 on that day — hence the minimum of 0."
   },
   {
    "id": "i2",
    "kind": "LineComment",
