    ],
    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "--- Week-alignment fields --- St. Tib's Day is not part of any Discordian week, so its alignment value is 0. In a regular month/year the values run 1–5 (days per week) or 1–15 (weeks per month)."
   },
   {
    "id": "i3",
    "kind": "LineComment",
    "lines": [
